%% Phase 3.5 scaffold — the three reconciler phases. Author should
%% expand each branch: Mount creates and rents from ElementPool;
%% Update does CanUpdate / replace-or-patch; Unmount returns to pool
%% and runs effect cleanups in reverse hook order.
flowchart TB
    Entry[Reconciler.Reconcile] -->|new is null| Unmount[Unmount path]
    Entry -->|existing is null| Mount[Mount path]
    Entry -->|both present| Update[Update path]
    Mount --> Pool1[ElementPool.TryRent]
    Update --> CanUpdate{CanUpdate?}
    CanUpdate -->|yes| Patch[UpdateXxx property writes]
    CanUpdate -->|no| Remount[Unmount then Mount]
    Unmount --> Cleanup[FlushEffectCleanups]
    Cleanup --> Pool2[ElementPool.Return]
